# Portable context

- Canonical rules: root `AGENTS.md` (do not fork into long Cursor-only docs).
- Before non-trivial work: read `docs/handoff/CURRENT.md` and `CONTEXT.md`.
- Before ending a coding session: update the handoff file.
- Shared types/schemas only from `@portable/shared`.
- Exhaustive switches on unions/enums with a `never` default.
- Imports stay at the top of the file.
